    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "Mystery House is the first graphical adventure game, developed by Ken and Roberta Williams in 1980 and inspired by the Agatha Christie story \"And Then There Were None\" as well as by the Willliams' experience with Colossal Cave Adventure by game designer Will Crowther. \r\n\r\nThis package contains the preserved source code plus images of the original game packaging, screenshots and technical documentation.",
